autosave-R4-7-lcls2:   * fixe the bug of NFS mounting for RTEMS in the last release 

autosave-R4-7-lcls1:   * Formal version of autosave-beta3, with the modification of
                         - back compatible interfaces for NFS mounting with autosave R4-7

autosave-beta3:        * Fix the bug of waveform restore when the array end mark of "}" is exactly
                         the 120th character of the string in the .sav file

autosave-beta2:        * Added the exception handling for empty NFS host settings
                         - if the user did not set the NFS host name and mounting point,
                           disable the NFS remounting functionality
                         - if the NFS access automatically recovered, stop trying to remount NFS
                       * Fixed the bug of wrongly displayed message of "Call back time out"

autosave-beta1:        * Synch with autosave R4-7
                       * Introduced NFS remount function for RTEMS in case of too many
                         file written failures
                       * Seperated the NFS mounting code to src/os folder for vxWorks, RTEMS
                         and Linux
                       * Added timeout checking for PERIODIC or MONITORED callback functions
                       * Enabled to reconnect the unconnected CA channels
                       * Used ca_create_channel + callback instead of ca_search
                       * Added illegal pointer checking at callback functions
                       * Added file checking after writting to the disk
                       * Disconnected all CA channels before existing the program
                       * Increased the size of info buffer for save list auto generation from
                         database

